      <size=20>FREE GAMES PLAYED</size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>Cash</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 10</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Cashing In Gold
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_CASH
    value: <style=title><size=32>CASH SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_CASH_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=20>- On reel 1, Cash symbols with values 1, 2, 5, and 10 appear.
      \  \n- On reel 2, Cash symbols with values 5 or 0 appear.\n- On reel 3, Cash
      symbols with values 5, 0 or 00 appear.\n- Slot pays whatever Cash symbol values
      that appear on the line, consecutively from reel 1, applied \n    by the bet
      multiplier.\n- Maximum Cash symbol value that may appear is 10500.</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DIAMOND_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=32>DIAMOND SYMBOLS & JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DIAMOND_JACKPOT_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=20>- Red and Blue Diamond symbols appear on all 3 reels.\r\n- 3
      Diamond symbols appearing on the line, regardless of color, triggers \n    Free
      Games.\r\n- 3 Red Diamonds appearing on the line awards the Grand Jackpot.\r\n-
      3 Blue Diamonds appearing on the line awards the Mega Jackpot.\r</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_FREE GAMES
    value: "<style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES\r</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_FREE GAMES_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=22>- Free Games awards 8 free spins.

      - 3 Diamond symbols appearing on the line, regardless of color, re-triggers
      8 Free Games.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_NUDGE FEATURE
    value: "<style=title><size=32>NUDGE FEATURE\r</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_NUDGE_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=22>- Nudge feature may be triggered randomly after reel stop. \n-
      During the feature, a reel may nudge up or down.\n- Nudge feature may trigger
      Free Games or award a cash win.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_RESPIN FEATURE
    value: <style=title><size=32>RE-SPIN FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_RESPIN_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=22>- Re-spin feature is triggered whenever a 0 or 00 Cash symbol
      lands on reels 2, 3, or\n    both, and there is no win.\r\n- During the feature,
      reels with 0 or 00 Cash symbols are locked, and remaining reels\n    are given
      a re-spin.\r</size>"
